            {
                "lineNumber": 224382,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "エロヤックALVと少し仲良くなり、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "and became a bit friendly with Eroyak ALV,"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224383,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "落語を聞かせてもらった。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "and listened to a rakugo performance."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224384,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "○○月××日――",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "Month XX, Day XX――"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224385,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "あなたは実家のある村に帰ってきていた。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "You had returned to the village where your family home was."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224386,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「ほーん、ここが＜エール＞の故郷かぁー」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Hoh, so this is <Aile>'s hometownー」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224387,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「普通の村だねえ」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「It's a normal village.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224388,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「クルックーさん、ここで生活していたんだぁ」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「So Krukku-san lived here.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224389,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「あの人はやることが謎というか、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「That person does mysterious things,"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224390,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　秘密主義というか……」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　or rather keeps a lot of secrets...」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224391,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「とりあえず相棒の家に行ってみようぜ！",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Anyway, let's go to my partner's house!"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224392,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　母ちゃんにも挨拶しておきたいしよ！」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　I want to greet mom too!」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224393,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "意気揚々と村の中を進み、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "Full of energy, you advanced through the village,"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224394,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "あなたは生まれ育った家についた。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "and arrived at the house where you were born and raised."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224395,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「あん？　鍵がかかってんな？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Huh? It's locked?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224396,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「あ、ドアに貼り紙があるぜ？",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Ah, there's a note on the door?"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224397,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　えーと、なになに？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Umm, let's see...?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224398,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「＜エール＞。お帰りなさい」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「<Aile>. Welcome home.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224399,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「突然ですが、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Suddenly, but"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224400,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　家の中には入れないようにしています」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　we have made it so you cannot enter the house.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224401,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「鍵なら村の裏手にある山、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「The key is in the mountain behind the village,"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224402,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　その中の迷宮にありますよ」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　inside the labyrinth there.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224403,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「だってさ……",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「So it says..."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224404,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　どうする？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　What do we do?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224405,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「ま……",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Well..."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224406,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　このまま帰るってのも癪だ。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Going back like this is annoying."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224407,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　行くか」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Let's go.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224408,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "あなた達は貼り紙の指示に従って、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "Following the note's instructions,"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224409,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "進んでみることにした。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "you decided to proceed."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224410,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「どこなんだ、ここはー！？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Where the hell is thisー!?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224411,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「おい！　次は西に行けっつってんぞ！」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Hey! It says go west next!」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224412,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「村の地下に更に迷宮が！？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「There's another labyrinth under the village!?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224413,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「わー、前が見えないー！」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Wah, I can't see aheadー!」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224414,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "あなた達の家の鍵を取るまでの冒険は",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "The adventure to get the key to your house"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224415,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "困難を極め、時刻も夕暮れになっていた。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "was extremely difficult, and it was already dusk."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224416,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「はあ……はあ……」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Haa... Haa...」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224417,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「つ、ついにゴールか……」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「F-finally the goal...」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224418,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「お馴染みの貼り紙が……",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「The familiar note..."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224419,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　えーと、なになに？」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Umm, let's see...?」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224420,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「よくぞここまで辿り着きましたね。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Well done reaching this far."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224421,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　おめでとうございます」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Congratulations.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224422,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「約束の宝……",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「The promised treasure..."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224423,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　それはあなたの隣にありますよ」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　It is right next to you.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224424,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "あなたの隣には長田君やザンス達がいた。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "Next to you were Nagata-kun, Zance and the others."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224425,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「宝とは、ここまで共に苦難を乗り越えた、",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「The treasure was the irreplaceable companions"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224426,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　かけがえのない仲間達のことだったのです。",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　who overcame hardships together with you."
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224427,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　ばばーん」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　Bam!」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224428,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「――という冗談は置いておいて」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「――That was a joke, by the way.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224429,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「冒険の途中で",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Trying to return midway through the adventure"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224430,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　帰ってこようとは甘いですね、＜エール＞」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　is too naive, <Aile>.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224431,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「ちゃんと、全てを終わらせてから",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Finish everything properly"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224432,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "　帰ってきなさい」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "　before coming back.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224433,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「それでは、行ってらっしゃい」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「Well then, have a safe trip.」"
            },
            {
                "lineNumber": 224434,
                "originalJapaneseLine": "「…………」",
                "translatedEnglishLine": "「............」"
            },
